menu "BM1370 Rust protocol experiment"
    config BM1370_PROTOCOL_RUST
        bool "Build the experimental bm13xx-protocol Rust adapter"
        default n
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
        help
            Use a pinned upstream bm13xx-protocol for BM1370 wire frames.
            UART, initialization sequences, power and fan control stay in C.

    config BM1370_PROTOCOL_SHADOW
        bool "Compare C/Rust frames while sending and using C results"
        depends on BM1370_PROTOCOL_RUST
        default y
        help
            Check every encoded frame and decoded response against C. Counters
            are logged periodically. Disable only after validating equivalence
            to use the Rust adapter's bytes and decoded fields directly.

    config BM1370_PROTOCOL_BENCHMARK
        bool "Run the identical-frame C/old-Rust/Rust benchmark once"
        depends on BM1370_PROTOCOL_RUST
        default n
        help
            Starts after 60 seconds on core 1 at low priority. Logs nine
            interleaved samples per case/backend, outside timed loops.
            Excludes UART and mining work preparation. Diagnostic builds only.
endmenu

menu "BM1370 fixed-capacity jobs"
    config BM1370_FIXED_JOBS
        bool "Use the bounded Rust job book for BM1370"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
        default n
        help
            Keeps 16 jobs in 6212 static bytes, with owned result snapshots.
            Job IDs over 256 bytes are rejected explicitly without truncation.
            Other ASIC families keep their existing job storage.

    config BM1370_JOBSTORE_TEST
        bool "Diagnostic only: force two pool reconnects after 120/240 seconds"
        depends on BM1370_FIXED_JOBS
        default n
        help
            Exercises live job invalidation and pool reconnects once per boot.
            Never enable in a production image.
endmenu
